d conditions\nare important to ensure that things go as expected when either\nmark is zero.\n\nNOTE: This is the only Protocol callback that is not called\nthrough EventLoop.call_soon() -- if it were, it would have no\neffect when it's most needed (when the app keeps writing\nwithout yielding until pause_writing() is called).","doc_summary":"Called when the transport's buffer goes over the high-water mark.","aliasOf":"aiohttp.base_protocol.BaseProtocol.pause_writing"},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.BaseProtocol.resume_reading","kind":"method","dispname":"resume_reading","docUri":null,"signature":"(self, resume_parser: bool = True) -> None","aliasOf":"aiohttp.base_protocol.BaseProtocol.resume_reading"},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.BaseProtocol.resume_writing","kind":"method","dispname":"resume_writing","docUri":null,"signature":"(self) -> None","doc":"Called when the transport's buffer drains below the low-water mark.\n\nSee pause_writing() for details.","doc_summary":"Called when the transport's buffer drains below the low-water mark.","aliasOf":"aiohttp.base_protocol.BaseProtocol.resume_writing"},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.BaseProtocol.transport","kind":"variable","dispname":"transport","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.BaseProtocol.writing_paused","kind":"property","dispname":"writing_paused","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.ClientConnectionResetError.__dict__","kind":"variable","dispname":"__dict__","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.ClientConnectionResetError.__doc__","kind":"constant","dispname":"__doc__","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.ClientConnectionResetError.__firstlineno__","kind":"constant","dispname":"__firstlineno__","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.ClientConnectionResetError.__module__","kind":"constant","dispname":"__module__","docUri":null,"signature":null},{"path":"aiohttp.http_writer.ClientConnectionResetError._